          "message": "[SQUASH] Advanced navigation \"extended/L\" gestures\n\n[someone5678]\n* Remove timeout settings\n* Add hook into system framework to use LineageOS' impl\n  instead of adding bunch of methods into SystemUI\n\nSqaushed commits:\n  Allow extended/\"L\" back swipe to trigger actions/app/activities [1/2]\n\n  screen off on long swipe is pretty nice :P\n\n  Change-Id: I2068cfce12d84daaaf5dce5380157dffe6255081\n\n  Allow a wider back swipe to trigger actions (instead of timeout) [1/2]\n\n  swipe for more than 3/4 of X axys display size to trigger action\n  instead of long swipe timeout\n\n  Change-Id: I3afea79e3ece99b3c5e2c1b53c1516e48337576a\n\n  Allow a \"L\" back swipe to trigger more actions [1/2]\n\n  even a fucked up \"L\" is good to trigger the action :D\n\n  also don't break normal back swipe if no action is set as extended swipe\n  action\n\n  Change-Id: I870f06b76bd9bacee262aa711e4af35ba8cb1f07\n  Signed-off-by: DennySPb <dennyspb@gmail.com>\n\n  Add switch last app to gesture actions [1/2]\n\n  Change-Id: I3690677bce0cdc85951b38790cf9374346b1e6c2\n  Signed-off-by: DennySPb <dennyspb@gmail.com>\n\n  LongSwipeGestures: Vibrate on action if gesture haptic feedback enabled\n\n  Change-Id: I4a17649320789497490ea4a2b6681dc51760d3b0\n  Signed-off-by: DennySPb <dennyspb@gmail.com>\n\n  Allow back swipe on bottom screen if launcher is showing\n\n  on the very bottom area of the screen (1/4 of display size)\n  so we can trigger our actions everywhere\n\n  Change-Id: I0ca2f5981664864d19a2560a77cfea6e95d304ae\n  Signed-off-by: DennySPb <dennyspb@gmail.com>\n\n  Extended swipe: show a double arrow when almost triggered\n\n  abcdu: adapted to our code\n  Change-Id: If8905cb231e5ea0e993a590ce7f02669b46b8136\n  Signed-off-by: DennySPb <dennyspb@gmail.com>\n\n  Advanced nav gestures: improve code and fix glitches\n\n  fix  arrows animation glitch after triggering an action\n  with the extended swipe\n\n  hide the arrows before triggering a screenshot action\n\n  code cleanup\n\n  Change-Id: I5f01938b6b688acd14225f58ce5a2032f083f92f\n  Co-authored-by: DennySPb <dennyspb@gmail.com>\n  Co-authored-by: Jayant-Deshmukh <jayantdeshmuk008@gmail.com>\n  Signed-off-by: DennySPb <dennyspb@gmail.com>\n  Signed-off-by: Jayant-Deshmukh <jayantdeshmuk008@gmail.com>\n\n  Show a double arrow when almost triggered in new back affordance as well\n\n  Change-Id: I781f91c0ff14415f0931484ad704cbe80fcc7df0\n\n  Gestures nav: Add Power menu action\n\n  Signed-off-by: spezi77 <spezi7713@gmx.net>\n  Change-Id: I11cbb003a03b17a981d957cf25aa28138426802d\n\n  Gestures nav: Add Partial Screenshot action\n\n  Signed-off-by: spezi77 <spezi7713@gmx.net>\n  Change-Id: Ie8045e35ecb19e4c07113865c6a092859aab9746\n\n  SystemUI: navigationbar: Flip canvas if gesture started from left\n\n  * Better than constant right arrow direction\n\n  Change-Id: I45108f185130d6f778660ba11f3beb758826ba99\n  Signed-off-by: someone5678 <someone5678@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n  SystemUI: BackPanel: Always add second arrow in front on long swipe\n\n  * After commit 8c78633ef747b5edfb06f8e2a3c2be4a34390e5a\n    if long swipe gesture started from left, second arrow is added\n    in back instead of front.\n\n  * This looks unnatural and causes inconsistency with right.\n\n  * Hardcode to -1 so that second arrow always added in front of first one.\n\n  Change-Id: Ia043a749218ab40c40520736fa54ffaa26919137\n  Signed-off-by: someone5678 <someone5678@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n  Gestures nav: Add back show recents action\n\n  Change-Id: I2a487bd6752724840a018cbe2cb369f7d774f876\n  Signed-off-by: someone5678 <someone5678@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n  Gestures nav: Make it cancelable\n\n  * Referenced from commit \"Implement edge long swipe gesture to new back gesture affordance\"\n  * Remove long back swipe timeout setting\n  * Execute long swipe action when movement changed from down to up\n  * Cancel when x pointer smaller than threshold\n  * Use double click effect instead of heavy click\n\n  Change-Id: Icab2864703d518f4fa78a438d0e225a094fa1308\n  Signed-off-by: someone5678 <someone5678@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n  Gesture nav: Add go forward action\n\n  * Used those for web browser\n\n  Change-Id: Id9a37d5f9f08cc682ac82d212fb09bda8ce7b1af\n  Signed-off-by: someone5678 <someone5678@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n  Gesture nav: Add back menu action\n\n  Change-Id: Idaa6f7496b6babee5735c9eecf41bb8b95f4ace4\n  Signed-off-by: someone5678 <someone5678@users.noreply.github.com>\n\nCo-authored-by: DennySPb <dennyspb@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Jayant-Deshmukh <jayantdeshmuk008@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: someone5678 <someone5678@users.noreply.github.com>\nChange-Id: I4c73becc7100a36f3b677a156d293e225f8ff92b\nSigned-off-by: DennySPb <dennyspb@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Jayant-Deshmukh <jayantdeshmuk008@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: someone5678 <someone5678@users.noreply.github.com>",
