        "body": "Bumps [io.jenkins.tools.bom:bom-2.479.x](https://github.com/jenkinsci/bom) from 3722.vcc62e7311580 to 3761.vd922730f0fd2.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/jenkinsci/bom/releases\">io.jenkins.tools.bom:bom-2.479.x's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>3761.vd922730f0fd2</h2>\n<h2>🚀 New features and improvements</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Add SonarQube Scanner to the managed set (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/jenkinsci/bom/issues/4007\">#4007</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/darinpope\"><code>@​darinpope</code></a></li>\n<li>Add Parameterized Scheduler to managed set (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/jenkinsci/bom/issues/4005\">#4005</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/darinpope\"><code>@​darinpope</code></a></li>\n<li>Add Amazon Web Services SDK 2 to the managed set (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/jenkinsci/bom/issues/4034\">#4034</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/darinpope\"><code>@​darinpope</code></a></li>\n<li>Add Artifact Manager Artifactory to the managed set (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/jenkinsci/bom/issues/4030\">#4030</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/darinpope\"><code>@​darinpope</code></a></li>\n<li>Add Artifactory Client API to the managed set (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/jenkinsci/bom/issues/4027\">#4027</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/darinpope\"><code>@​darinpope</code></a></li>\n<li>Add Flatpickr API to the managed set (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/jenkinsci/bom/issues/4023\">#4023</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/darinpope\"><code>@​darinpope</code></a></li>\n<li>Add Display URL for Blue Ocean to the managed set (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/jenkinsci/bom/issues/4022\">#4022</a>) <a href=\"https://github.com/darinpope\"><code>@​darinpope</code></a></li>\n<li>Add GitHub Custom Notification Context SCM Behaviour to managed set (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/jenkinsci/bom/issues/4021\">#4021</a>) <a href=\"https:/