        "body": "### Error Message and Logs\r\n\r\nCloning into '.'...\r\nPermission denied, please try again.\r\nPermission denied, please try again.\r\ngit@gitlab.com ( changed ): Permission denied (publickey,password).\r\nfatal: Could not read from remote repository.\r\n\r\nPlease make sure you have the correct access rights\r\nand the repository exists.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Steps to Reproduce\r\n\r\n1. Generate SSH key pair in Coolify's Key & Token management.\r\n2. Copy public key to GitLab repository's Deploy Keys.\r\n3. Create new project in Coolify, entering Git repository URL and required details.\r\n4. Load Docker Compose file for the project.\r\n5. Attempt to clone repository, resulting in SSH authentication failure.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Example Repository URL\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Coolify Version\r\n\r\nv4.0.0.0-beta.35o\r\n\r\n### Are you using Coolify Cloud?\r\n\r\nNo ( Self Hosted )\r\n\r\n### Operating System and Version (self-hosted)\r\n\r\nUbuntu 22.04\r\n\r\n### Additional Information\r\n\r\n<img width=\"366\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b90ad17-e493-45c6-8551-a1b43b651b4b\">\r\n<img width=\"1367\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d9381f19-03fc-4d00-88b5-8e458ae4ad3c\">\r\n",
