          "merged_at": null
        },
        "body": "This rewrites part of `qx.io.jsonrpc.(Client|Request)` in order to fix some incorrect Promise handling. However, the bug cannot be fully fixed with the current use of `qx.Promise`, which has a bug/incompatibility that produces the \"unhandled rejection\" error. To make current code work, it is necessary to add `qx.io.jsonrpc.protocol.Request.useNativePromise();` to your code, which has been introduced to be able to switch to the native Promise implementation without breaking compatibility (although I very much doubt that anyone has been relying on this dependency). In qooxdoo 8.0, the implementation will use the native `Promise` implementation by default and this method will be deprecated.  ",
