        "body": "## Problem solved\n\nShort description of the bug fixed or feature added\n\n\n\n<!-- start pr-codex -->\n\n---\n\n## PR-Codex overview\nThis PR focuses on improving URL handling for teams and projects by decoding the `team_slug` and enhancing the validation process for team URLs in the settings UI.\n\n### Detailed summary\n- Updated `team_slug` retrieval to decode the URL component in `layout.tsx` files.\n- Enhanced project lookup to decode `team_slug` in `layout.tsx`.\n- Replaced `isTeamTaken` state with `errorMessage` for error handling in `TeamGeneralSettingsPageUI.tsx`.\n- Added validation for team URL input to check for emptiness and special characters.\n\n> ✨ Ask PR-Codex anything about this PR by commenting with `/codex {your question}`\n\n<!-- end pr-codex -->",
