        "body": ":robot: I have created a release *beep* *boop*\n---\n\n\n## [13.0.0](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/compare/v12.2.0...v13.0.0) (2025-01-01)\n\n\n### ⚠ BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* **parser:** Remove old comment node\n* **Log:** Convert Log class to module ([#814](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/814))\n* **parser:** Remove getters that have been deprecated for a long time ([#815](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/815))\n* **parser:** Implement endpoint/command parsers ([#812](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/812))\n* Deprecate `account#getAnalytics`, `account#getTimeWatched` and `account#getAnalytics`\n* **Innertube#getPlaylists:** Return a `Feed` instance instead of items\n* **OAuth2:** Rewrite auth module ([#661](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/661))\n* **toDash:** Add support for generating manifests for Post Live DVR videos ([#580](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/580))\n* **Library:** Add support for the new layout and remove profile & stats info\n* **Channel:** YouTube removed the \"Channels\" tab on channels, so this pull request removes the `getChannels()` method and `has_channels` getter from the `YT.Channel` class, as they are no longer useful. The featured channels are now shown on the channel home tab. To get them you can use the `channels` getter on the home tab of the channel. Please note that some channel owners might not have added that section to their home page yet, so you won't be able to get the featured channels for those channels. The home tab is the default tab that is returned when you call `InnerTube#getChannel()`, you can also access that tab by calling `getHome()` on a `YT.Channel` object.\n* **music#getSearchSuggestions:** Return array of `SearchSuggestionsSection` instead of a single node\n* replace unnecessary classes with pure functions ([#468](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/468))\n* overhaul core classes and remove redundant code ([#388](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/388))\n\n### Features\n\n* **account:** Add missing property `channel_handle` ([#789](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/789)) ([677e1f0](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/677e1f08075a4a59274f89f3eb65967d7d0ab01b))\n* **Actions:** Allow auth check to be skipped ([67f13ff](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/67f13fffacec2c655a03d66c6d8016620d9abcf9))\n* add `FeedNudge` ([#533](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/533)) ([e021395](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/e02139532b2c07aaf72dd1bd8610f63b6780001d))\n* Add `getCourses` ([#798](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/798)) ([cfb48fa](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/cfb48fab89792d87a7377eaf15a56d289d26769b))\n* Add `MWEB` client ([4bf125b](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/4bf125b6a53460f631410e1ab949a16cc0c7d095))\n* Add `TVHTML5` InnerTube client ([b45609a](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/b45609aa0fcd801c379ffdafd04c6c3c2ed3deba))\n* add `VideoAttributeView` ([#531](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/531)) ([ff4ab16](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/ff4ab1680e110fc32e09d09215fd3e05dbde2c85))\n* add `VideoMetadataCarouselView` ([#839](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/839)) ([9a9bb76](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/9a9bb76a928594c5c5f3e828c86081bf79c2562d))\n* Add `WEB_CREATOR` client ([#757](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/757)) ([dd7f5cf](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/dd7f5cf778b8acca95cc6d9c6e379e3e87e0ee8a))\n* Add `WEB_EMBEDDED` client ([#756](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/756)) ([eaf218f](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/eaf218f5da758fc37d71f7d00ba9e42533194f8a))\n* Add Shorts endpoint ([#512](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/512)) ([a32aa8c](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/a32aa8c633b6f3c3bb0695ad1878cbb313867346))\n* Add support for retrieving transcripts ([#500](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/500)) ([f94ea6c](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/f94ea6cf917f63f30dd66514b22a4cf43b948f07))\n* add support of cloudflare workers ([#596](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/596)) ([2029aec](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/2029aec90de3c0fdb022094d7b704a2feed4133b))\n* **Channel:** Add `getPodcasts()` method ([f267fcd](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/f267fcd8beccf237b8d1924463990273887cae28))\n* **Channel:** Add `getReleases()` method ([f267fcd](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/f267fcd8beccf237b8d1924463990273887cae28))\n* **ChannelMetadata:** Add `music_artist_name` ([#497](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/497)) ([91de6e5](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/91de6e5c0e5b27e6d12ce5db2f500c5ff78b9830))\n* **Channel:** Support getting about with PageHeader ([#581](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/581)) ([2e710dc](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/2e710dc9f7e206627f189df19be17009b270bc8b))\n* **Channel:** Support new about popup ([#537](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/537)) ([c66eb1f](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/c66eb1fecf0e66d9eca841be0ca56b39ad4466eb))\n* **Channel:** Support PageHeader being used on user channels ([#577](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/577)) ([6082b4a](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/6082b4a52ee07a622735e6e9128a0531a5ae3bfb))\n* **CommentView:** Implement comment interaction methods ([1c08bfe](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/1c08bfe113804c69fbc4e49b42442d9a63d73be6))\n* Enable importHelpers in tsconfig to reduce output size ([#378](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/378)) ([0b301de](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/0b301de6a1e1352a64881c1751a84360922a77cd))\n* **EngagementPanelTitleHeader:** Add `contextual_info` and `menu` ([af3a916](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/af3a91645d84798e744519ec8f24e565cc1ecdb1))\n* extend music getInfo to a