ub.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/95ed60207a1219f4891f28d2b2b90cf816f11831))\n\n\n### Miscellaneous Chores\n\n* **parser:** Remove getters that have been deprecated for a long time ([#815](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/815)) ([9cf0d3f](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/9cf0d3f3b3099af3dd59bc4ca99fefe217a91020))\n\n\n### Code Refactoring\n\n* Deprecate `account#getAnalytics`, `account#getTimeWatched` and `account#getAnalytics` ([0081e11](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/0081e11ebcff8c719902d93edf8760d3e8702e00))\n* **Innertube#getPlaylists:** Return a `Feed` instance instead of items ([7660450](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/766045049d7154866e6fe32f6d965025d736d77d))\n* **OAuth2:** Rewrite auth module ([#661](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/661)) ([b6ce5f9](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/b6ce5f903fa2285cb381d73aedf02cc5e2712478))\n* overhaul core classes and remove redundant code ([#388](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/388)) ([95e0294](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/95e0294eabfdb20bbee2a4bfb751fd101402c5d6))\n* **parser:** Implement endpoint/command parsers ([#812](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/812)) ([7397aa3](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/7397aa3f6425cb2f3dcc625502fd1ce5a5db6db3))\n* **parser:** Remove old comment node ([2f087d4](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/2f087d47a0199870b313717f3d01598f8168be4b))\n* replace unnecessary classes with pure functions ([#468](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/issues/468)) ([87ed396](https://github.com/iShibi/YouTube.js/commit/87ed3960ffa1c738b6f3b5acaf423647db4d367e))\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [Release Please](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please). See [documentation](https://github.com/googleapis/release-please#release-please).",
